    "Equal-output checks and three samples; no timing assertions. A native Debug server build ran concurrently, so timings are illustrative.",
    "Dictionary decode fixture: 4096 rows, 32 integer columns, four values per column, SQL NULLs, compressed typed spill blocks. Compact decode retains primitive unique entries and row IDs without a Datum matrix.",
